---
// Creed section ported from about/index.html. One blocked lineage phrase is dropped from the Excellence paragraph (owner undecided).
---
<section class="edc-creed-section" id="creed" aria-labelledby="creed-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="edc-banner">
      <div class="edc-badge-pill">USA Wrestling Regional Training Center #513</div>
      <h2 id="creed-heading" class="edc-motto-display">
        <span class="motto-word">Excellence</span>{" "}
        <span class="motto-divider" aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <span class="motto-word">Discipline</span>{" "}
        <span class="motto-divider" aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
        <span class="motto-word">Champions</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="edc-lead">The three standards behind every practice at United Wrestling Club in Hayward,&nbsp;California.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="edc-pillars">
      <article class="edc-pillar">
        <div class="pillar-marker"><span class="pillar-num">01</span><span class="pillar-tag">The Standard</span></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Excellence</h3>
        <h4 class="pillar-subtitle">Technical Mastery</h4>
        <p class="pillar-body">Wrestling is physics under pressure. Rooted in Coach Naweed's Kinesiology foundation, we drill 2-on-1 Russian ties, explosive level changes, and hip control.</p>
        <div class="pillar-quote">&ldquo;Technique is the great equalizer on the mat.&rdquo;</div>
      </article>

      <article class="edc-pillar">
        <div class="pillar-marker"><span class="pillar-num">02</span><span class="pillar-tag">The Grind</span></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Discipline</h3>
        <h4 class="pillar-subtitle">Relentless Work Ethic</h4>
        <p class="pillar-body">No shortcuts. No excuses. Discipline means showing up when you're tired, holding stance when your legs burn, and staying accountable to your training partner.</p>
        <div class="pillar-quote">&ldquo;How you do anything is how you do everything.&rdquo;</div>
      </article>

      <article class="edc-pillar">
        <div class="pillar-marker"><span class="pillar-num">03</span><span class="pillar-tag">The Outcome</span></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Champions</h3>
        <h4 class="pillar-subtitle">Character in the Circle</h4>
        <p class="pillar-body">A champion is defined before the whistle and long after the hand is raised. We build humble winners and respectful leaders who carry the mat's quiet confidence into the classroom.</p>
        <div class="pillar-quote">&ldquo;Once you've wrestled, everything else in life is easy.&rdquo;</div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
